WEBVTT

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:37.780
Oh, my goodness!

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:44.450
Sure is quiet...

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:47.210
It doesn't look like there's any of those guys around.

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.370
Joey, look at that!

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:57.460
What is that monstrous mushroom?

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:02.090
Hey, Psy... Let's hurry to the emergency shelter.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:04.700
Who knows when they'll come again.

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:08.010
Yeah. That sounds like a good idea.

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:14.830
All right, let's go.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.820
Hey, Will, this is kinda...

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:22.820
<i>Episode #4 Sphere</i>

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:28.430
Lord Kogorr, our forces have finished withdrawing.

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:31.540
Although it is only a trifle, we have suffered some small losses.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:35.830
They try and resist, but it is futile.

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:39.780
Now, proceed to the second stage of the plan!

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:40.700
Yes, Lord.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:57.600
It's a lot bigger than it looks from afar.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.480
Where can we get in?

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.860
That's what we're going to look for now.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:07.830
Hey, don't you think maybe we should go back?

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.630
You want to go back? Then go by yourself.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:12.140
I didn't mean...

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:15.790
What is it?

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:45.760
Hey, Will...

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.700
What are you planning on doing?

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.710
I told you, remember? We're going to be the heroes.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:57.540
I think we're already plenty good heroes sneaking into the enemy's base...

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.440
That's not good enough!

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:02.230
Then what is?

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.590
You want to know?

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.890
We're going to steal their weapons!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.550
Then we'll take them all down!

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:15.530
That's impossible!

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:16.740
No, it's not!

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:19.530
We've made it all the way here, after all.

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:20.690
Uh...

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.610
Here.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.860
Thank you.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:33.040
Joey!

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:34.800
Lina!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.160
Thank goodness, you're safe!

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.560
Yeah! Grandma's safe, too.

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:40.910
Hello!

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:42.010
Hello, my dear.

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.350
Lina, where's the Professor?

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:48.130
Professor Denton went back to the school a little while ago.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.200
Let's go.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.840
I'm sure the Professor knows something.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:52.640
Yeah.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:55.750
Grandma, I'm going back out for a bit.

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:58.560
Wait a second!

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:02.930
Do you know where Nick and my brother are?

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:05.310
I haven't seen them around here for a while.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.660
Will and Nick?

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.910
Where are you planning on going?

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:14.370
I'll never accept someone like <i>you</i> being a hero!

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:19.460
I sure hope that guy isn't doing anything reckless...

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.760
Will...

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.800
I'm sure he's fine.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.380
We'll look for him later.

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:26.880
Thank you.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.090
First comes the Professor.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:30.580
Come on, Joey.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:30.930
Right.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:33.390
Joey, be careful!

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:34.980
I know!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.220
Professor Denton!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.050
Oh, it's you two.

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:49.230
What are you doing at a time like this?

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:51.810
Now is <i>exactly</i> the time to do this!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:52.940
Take a look at this.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:54.810
That's...

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:56.640
...one of the alien's weapons!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.150
Exactly!

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:02.130
It was tossed aside from the wreckage of one of the ones your robot defeated.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:05.600
It's hyper-advanced technology the defies description!

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:09.680
With this I can understand why the military was completely useless.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:12.760
How do you figure that?

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.350
Anyway, it's amazing!

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.810
I can't even put it into words to explain!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:20.350
In other words, you don't really understand.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:23.670
Well, this is all basically my fault.

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:26.750
Each time some part of this city was destroyed,

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:29.360
I felt my heart be torn more and more to shreds!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.940
However!

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:33.930
That is exactly why I can't run away from this!

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:38.580
In order to atone for the sins I have committed, I must act!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.470
These are my true feelings!

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:43.410
So then, Joey...

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:45.020
Uh, yes?

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:48.780
That robot of yours... It's called, "Heroman," yes?

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:51.300
Would you let me disassemble it?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.870
N-No!

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:59.980
But if I can uncover how that robot operates, we can fight back against them!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.910
It'd greatly increase our offensive potential...

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:03.810
Whatever, Professor!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.400
Have you figured anything out about them?

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.050
Well, you see...

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:11.120
I understand, but I don't really understand...

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.760
Well, there's <i>some</i> things I've figured out...

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:18.210
Um, can you cut to the chase here?

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.550
Oh?

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.580
Fine then.

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.380
They are called the Skrugg.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.180
From their outward appearance,

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:30.660
I could imagine them as some sort of evolved form of cockroach.

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:32.230
However!

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:38.260
They possess incredible technology based on science that human beings have yet to even imagine!

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.320
And...?

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.260
And?

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:43.270
And what?

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:45.640
Do they have a weak point or something?

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.570
Are they weak against germs?

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.360
Or can't stand the cold?

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:54.650
You expect me to determine that kind of thing in such a short time?

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:58.320
In other words, you haven't figured anything out.

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:03.130
It's true that everything's full of mysteries right now.

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:06.450
But there is one thing I know.

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:09.970
The strength to surpass the overwhelming power of the Skrugg...

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:13.590
...is possessed by Heroman.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:20.980
Heroman holds the key to this battle, Joey!

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:41.960
These are amazing.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.710
Look for some weapons we can use.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.880
Damn it, it won't budge...

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:54.920
It's no use.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.850
How do you work it?

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:03.810
What happened?

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:08.580
W-Whoa!

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.360
Let me have it!

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:14.110
With this, I can fight them!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:19.190
H-Hold up, Will!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.480
A dead-end?

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:29.750
Something isn't right, Will.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:33.100
I'm sure this is the way we came before...

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:36.090
Let's turn back.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:44.720
Was there a passageway here before?

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:46.890
Will!

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.900
Stop crying like a little sissy!

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:51.990
Will!

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:01.710
This is a pretty big room.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:03.920
Look at that!

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:24.340
Damn it!

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:26.360
Why won't it shoot? Damn it!

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:58.100
We have captured some intruders.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:01.050
Did you little bugs get lost?

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:02.990
Bugs...

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:05.050
<i>You're</i> the damn bugs!

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:09.990
You'd best know your place, feeble human.

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:13.040
But, worry not.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:16.820
This world will soon fall into our hands.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:21.110
Thanks to those weapons you fools saw.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:23.070
You think we'll let you?!

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:25.620
Take them away!

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:26.480
Yes, Lord.

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:31.190
Open the main gate!

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:34.120
Proceed to stage 3 of the plan!

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:54.880
Now, go! Mow down all before you!

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:01.990
Ready?

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.490
Okay, here I go!

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:07.460
Heroman Engage!

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.420
And nothing happens...

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:15.350
Maybe he didn't say it right.

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:18.830
I guess it only reacts to you, Joey.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:23.720
Heroman... Engage!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.030
What's that?

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.890
It wasn't me!

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.450
Definitely not me!

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.110
We know!

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.460
See something?

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.370
A sphere?

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.650
A perfect sphere indeed.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:55.040
Now's not the time to be impressed!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.650
That sphere is heading this way!

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:00.360
If it keeps going in that direction...

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:06.470
This is not good!

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:15.140
Psy, Professor... You two evacuate everyone.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.700
No, I'm coming with you.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:21.100
I must take responsibility!

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:27.980
I have a duty to take responsibility for the people of this city... no, for the world!

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:29.530
I understand.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.060
Let's go, Joey.

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:35.600
Psy, everyone's counting on you.

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:37.250
Leave them to me!

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:47.930
It's kind of... big.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.610
I'm doing it now.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:51.600
Let's go.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.030
Heroman...

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.400
Engage!

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:22.780
Heroman!

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:24.300
Are you okay?

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:43.360
Heroman... Attack!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:46.480
All right!

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:52.710
What? It didn't even make a dent.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.370
Come on now, hurry.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.870
Everyone over here. Quickly!

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:01.250
Watch your step.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.090
Hurry! Hurry and get to safety!

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:08.260
This is bad. They're not going to make it at this rate.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.010
We're counting on you, Joey!

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.280
It's not working at all.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:18.810
Joey!

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.520
Professor Denton!

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:23.230
Joey...

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:26.580
Professor, that sphere is incredibly hard.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:32.070
I know. And I have a plan about that.

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:36.920
We'll trap that sphere in a hole.

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:38.330
A hole?

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:41.220
Oh, don't worry.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:43.740
I'm not talking about digging one now.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.940
Then, how?

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:53.120
A subway station and underground mall are being constructed under here.

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:59.770
And there's a large cavity that's been made to construct the extension to the tracks.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:05.400
I see! So we open up a hole here, and then the sphere drops into it.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:08.300
I'd rather not destroy things,

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:10.580
but it's better than losing people's lives.

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:12.110
Can you do it?

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:15.110
I'll try.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.750
Heroman...

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:25.360
Attack!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.280
All right!

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.840
Woohoo!

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.640
This is nonsense...

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.770
This is complete nonsense!

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.600
Quickly, everyone!

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:29.930
Hurry!

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:31.130
Hurry up!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.070
Grandma, you need to evacuate.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:36.760
It looks delicious...

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:37.950
What?

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:42.410
Please stop it, Heroman!

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:34.090
He finally stopped it!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.140
Don't, Heroman!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.860
That's enough! That's enough I say!

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:58.990
Heroman!

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:21.130
Heroman!

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:42.190
Heroman...

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:48.120
Heroman is telling me not to give up... To fight together!

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:51.200
Heroman...

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:53.670
Augment!

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.810
Heroman...

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.060
...turned into a giant...

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:16.360
What's that?

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:41.670
That's the way!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:47.090
Don't let up! You've got to hold out until everyone's evacuated!

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:48.500
Right...

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:05.950
Joey!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.250
Everyone's evacuated!

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:09.400
Right!

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:12.160
Heroman, move away from the sphere!

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:33.560
What is that white thing?

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:37.270
Do they actually possess a power that can oppose us?

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:50.450
Good going, Joey!

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:52.160
No, it's not over.

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:56.370
If we don't do something about that sphere...

00:21:57.490 --> 00:21:58.500
Joey.

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:24.090
<b>"Can you hear this voice?"</b>

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:31.560
<b>I've been calling that, always, from deep within my heart.</b>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:45.460
<b>Would you, all alone, let another lonely one be next to you?</b>

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:51.010
<b>Because together it's not lonely, it's twoly.</b>

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:56.140
<b>See, you're not alone any longer.</b>

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:59.990
<b>Just because there's no one next to me</b>

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:02.540
<b>doesn't mean that I'm lonely!</b>

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:07.740
<b>For someone to notice this pain</b>

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:13.270
<b>that heart must have surely cried.</b>

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.650
<b>Right now, we'll crush to bits</b>

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:20.350
<b>the fortress of our limitless sadness!</b>

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:24.050
<b>I'll take you with me!</b>

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:27.730
<b>Got it? I'm running through at full power.</b>

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:31.470
<b>To where you're waiting, left behind</b>

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:34.640
<b>in the place of tears...</b>

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:39.770
<b>I believe in you, with burning passion!</b>

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:43.560
<b>Come to me!</b>

00:23:50.690 --> 00:23:52.890
On the next Heroman:

00:23:52.890 --> 00:23:56.520
No way! Could that... Could that be?

00:23:56.520 --> 00:23:59.480
Thanks to Heroman's actions, the people of the city evacuated safely.

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:04.020
But the Skrugg do not rest, and intensify their attacks.

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:07.520
Joey and the others head to a battlefield with no breakthrough in sight.

00:24:07.520 --> 00:24:11.560
And what stands before their eyes are new assassins.

00:24:11.560 --> 00:24:15.960
Next time on Heroman Episode #5: Assassins!

00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:18.860
Heroman... Attack!
